What the hell happened here? anaClassifyAll() - classifies the used parameters of every command, then checks the command (check_command)
What the hell happened here? r12 = the record, r14 = the allowed types still to do (9 bits each), rbx = parameter index, rbp = the parameter
What the hell happened here? Monke labels: uauaaaa|aaaa = next command, aaau = all done, aaua = next parameter, aauu = parameters done
